    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an agile space fighter and protect a vulnerable planet from endless waves of enemies. In <i>Celestial Wardens</i>, strategy meets action: pilot your ship in real-time while constructing planetary defenses in a unique blend of top-down shooting and tower defense mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Massive enemy waves with different threats.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Build planetary turrets to defend your planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Upgrade your ship with new weapons, modules, and special techs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Passive resource income from the planet \u2014 enhance the economy or defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Research new technologies to gain access to new buildings and ship modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, adapt, and stand as the last line of defense. Will your ship be enough?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an agile space fighter and protect a vulnerable planet from endless waves of enemies. In <i>Celestial Wardens</i>, strategy meets action: pilot your ship in real-time while constructing planetary defenses in a unique blend of top-down shooting and tower defense mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Massive enemy waves with different threats.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Build planetary turrets to defend your planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Upgrade your ship with new weapons, modules, and special techs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Passive resource income from the planet \u2014 enhance the economy or defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Research new technologies to gain access to new buildings and ship modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, adapt, and stand as the last line of defense. Will your ship be enough?</p>",
    "short_description": "Celestial Wardens is a sci-fi tower defense game where you command a lone spaceship to defend a planet under siege. Survive waves of enemies, build turrets, upgrade your ship, and manage your planet to prevent total annihilation.",
